UPDATE companies SET description='Specialty Foods is a family-owned and family-operated food manufacturer based in La Vergne, Tennessee, in the heart of Middle Tennessee. The company was founded in 2009 by Randall "Randy" Sanders, who identified a gap in the bread market for a top-quality product baked with fine ingredients that delivered a genuine homemade taste. Sanders was later joined by his two sons, Wesley and Will, and together they built the business around three distinct brand lines.

The company produces three product families: Ma''s Kitchen, which began in 1985 with a sourdough bread recipe passed down for over a century and initially supplied to restaurant chains; Ginny''s Homemade Waffles, made with an age-old recipe that includes imported pearl sugar; and Mama Turney''s Homemade Pies. Specialty Foods serves both the food-service channel and the consumer marketplace, emphasizing the use of the freshest ingredients and consistent quality across every batch.

Its customers include restaurant chains, food-service distributors, and retail consumers seeking wholesale or direct purchase options. The company highlights its wholesale resources and food-service resources as part of its offering, targeting operators who value consistent, made-from-scratch baked goods.

Sanders started Specialty Foods to deliver the true look, feel, and taste of homemade baking at a commercial scale, and the company states that its commitment to quality and consistency—every bite, every time—sets it apart from competitors.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sourdough bread production", "Waffle manufacturing", "Pie baking", "Food service supply", "Wholesale distribution", "Family recipe development"], "industries": ["Food service", "Consumer marketplace", "Restaurant chains"], "materials": ["Imported pearl sugar", "Fresh ingredients"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family recipes spanning over 100 years", "Imported pearl sugar in waffle recipe", "Commitment to consistency and freshest ingredients", "Serving both food-service and consumer markets", "Three distinct brand lines: Ma''s Kitchen, Ginny''s Waffles, Mama Turney''s Pies"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2009 by Randall ''Randy'' Sanders -> /about", "Family-owned and family-operated -> /", "Headquartered in La Vergne, Tennessee -> db", "Three product lines: Ma''s Kitchen, Ginny''s Homemade Waffles, Mama Turney''s Pies -> /", "Ma''s Kitchen started in 1985 with family sourdough recipe -> /", "Ginny''s Waffles use imported pearl sugar -> /", "Serves food service and consumer markets -> /", "Focus on quality and consistency -> /about", "Joined by sons Wesley and Will -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We''re a family-owned, family-operated food company located in the heart of Middle Tennessee.", "founded_year": "2009", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='specialty-foods' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
