UPDATE companies SET description='St. Cousair, Inc. operates a 26,000-square-foot, state-of-the-art production facility in Newberg, Oregon, situated in the Willamette Valley with convenient access to local ingredients and national distribution networks. The company has accumulated over 40 years of product development and production experience for retail and food-service channels.

