UPDATE companies SET description='Standard Electric Supply Co. is headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana, and has operated as a family-owned electrical distributor since its founding in 1919.

The company maintains 16 stocking locations across Wisconsin, Illinois, and Indiana, holding over $45 million in inventory to support same-day shipping on orders placed by 2 p.m. CST. Its distribution portfolio spans automation components, batteries, hardware, conduit, enclosures, fuses, industrial controls, lighting, motors, drives, sensors, safety equipment, tools, wire, and cable. Beyond product supply, Standard Electric provides 24/7 engineering support, inventory management, enclosure modification, repair services, kitting and custom assemblies, national customer solutions, IIoT integration, a 24-hour support line, and training seminars. The company reports an on-time delivery rate exceeding 99 percent.

Standard Electric serves original equipment manufacturers (OEMs) and maintenance, repair, and operations (MRO) environments across industrial sectors. The company''s services are tailored to reduce downtime and manage inventory risk for operations teams facing lean staffing and high reliability demands.

President Larry Stern emphasizes a "tradition of innovation and service" built on continuous improvement, aiming to reduce complexity for customers through fewer handoffs, clearer communication, and accountability for outcomes rather than just orders. The firm''s long-term partnership model focuses on adapting support to each facility''s unique constraints, whether through engineering expertise, inventory programs, or technical training.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["24/7 Engineering Support", "Inventory Management Service", "Enclosure Modification Service", "Repair Services", "Kitting & Custom Assemblies", "National Customer Solutions", "IIoT Integration", "24-Hour Customer Support Line", "Training & Seminars"], "industries": ["Industrial automation and control", "OEM", "MRO"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping on in-stock orders placed by 2pm CST M-F", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day shipping on in-stock orders placed by 2 p.m. CST Monday\u2013Friday", "24/7 technical support line", "16 stocking locations across Wisconsin, Illinois, and Indiana", "Over $45 million of inventory on hand", "On-time delivery rate exceeding 99%"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1919, family-owned, fourth generation -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana -> db", "16 stocking locations across Wisconsin, Illinois, Indiana -> /about-us", "Over $45 million inventory on hand -> /about-us", "On-time delivery rate exceeding 99% -> /about-us", "Same-day shipping on in-stock orders placed by 2pm CST M-F -> /, /about-us", "24/7 technical support -> /, /about-us", "Services: 24/7 Engineering Support, Inventory Management Service, Enclosure Modification Service, Repair Services, Kitting & Custom Assemblies, National Customer Solutions, IIoT, 24-Hour Customer Support Line, Training & Seminars -> /about-us", "Focus on industrial automation and control, OEM and MRO environments -> /about-us", "President Lar