UPDATE companies SET description='Steel House operates from Indianapolis, Indiana, as a steel service center, fabrication shop, and metal retail store. The company serves contractors, businesses, homeowners, and the construction industry with a focus on quick turnaround.

Steel House also stocks a wide inventory of structural steel, decorative iron, pipe, tube, plate, and sheet, and operates six delivery trucks, some equipped with 63-foot cranes for rooftop or jobsite placement.

Customers include general contractors, commercial builders, and residential clients who need structural components such as columns, beams, handrails, dumpster gates, stairs, and pipe bollards. The company also supplies embed plates and perimeter angles for concrete construction, and provides CAD drawing support for plasma-cut parts.

Steel House differentiates itself with a walk-in showroom where light fabrication—cut, punch, form, or weld—can be completed while the customer waits, and with same-day or next-day delivery on stock material. The firm emphasizes rapid quoting, in-house CAD for plasma cutting, and a single-source model that combines material supply, fabrication, and installation.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["MIG welding", "TIG welding", "Stick welding", "Shearing (3/8\" x 10'' and 1/2\" x 10'' hydraulic shears)", "Hole punching (up to 1\" diameter)", "Saw cutting (horizontal band saws, up to 16\" diameter)", "Nelson stud welding", "CNC plasma cutting (up to 2\" thick plate)", "Press brake forming (250-ton, up to 3/8\" plate x 10'')", "Pipe bollard fabrication", "Rebar bending", "Painting", "Same-day/next-day delivery", "Material stocking and supply", "CAD drawing support"], "industries": ["Construction", "Contractors", "Homeowners", "Commercial building", "Industrial safety"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Structural steel (beams, columns)", "Pipe and tube", "Plate and sheet", "Decorative iron", "Rebar", "Nelson studs"], "equipment": ["3/8\" x 10'' hydraulic shear", "1/2\" x 10'' hydraulic shear", "Two horizontal band saws (16\" diameter capacity)", "Hydraulic water saw", "Nelson stud gun", "CNC plasma cutting machine", "250-ton hydraulic press brake", "Six delivery trucks", "Trucks with 63-foot cranes"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Stock material delivery within 24-48 hours; light fabrication within hours or minutes; same-day Nelson stud welding; same-day/next-day delivery", "tolerances": "Shearing tolerance -0/+0.125\" per dimension", "built_on": ["Walk-in light fabrication with pickup within minutes", "Same-day or next-day delivery on stock material", "Same-day Nelson stud welding service", "CNC plasma cutting with in-house CAD drawing support", "Six delivery trucks including 63-foot crane units"], "facts_used": ["Lo