UPDATE companies SET description='Stout''s Metal Products operates from Collingswood, New Jersey, where it was officially established in 1985 by Larry Stout and his wife Julianne. The business traces its roots to the 1960s when Larry''s father, Ken Stout, a former Navy Yard shipbuilder, opened an ornamental metal shop in Atco. In 1984 the couple purchased a 300‑year‑old property with a rear workspace that had served as an 1880s ice house, a trailer storage shed, and a chicken coop, converting it into their fabrication shop.

The company provides custom metal fabrication and welding services, producing railings and balcony systems (steel, aluminum, wrought iron), ornamental and security fences and gates, ADA‑compliant safety railings, window security bars, and custom metal furniture, truck racks, dock ramps, Bilco doors, and artistic metalwork. They also offer on‑site and mobile welding for structural steel modification, equipment repair, and emergency fixes. The shop serves residential, commercial, and trade clients across South Jersey, eastern Pennsylvania, and the Jersey Shore, with over 8,000 projects completed.

Customers include homeowners, contractors, business owners, and property managers. Notable projects include railings for the Scottish Rite Auditorium, steel piping for the Battleship New Jersey dock in Camden, and a custom iron gate for former Eagles linebacker Jeremiah Trotter. The firm''s work has been featured in the local Courier Post newspaper.

The Stouts emphasize understanding each client''s needs, maintaining clear communication and schedules, and delivering work to the highest standard every time. They describe their motivation as carrying on a family passion, preserving the art of ornamental metalwork, and creating quality pieces that last for generations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Welding (shop and mobile/on-site)", "Railing fabrication (steel, aluminum, wrought iron)", "Balcony system fabrication", "Fence and gate fabrication", "Security bar fabrication", "ADA-compliant railing fabrication", "Custom metal furniture fabrication", "Truck rack fabrication", "Dock ramp fabrication", "Bilco door fabrication", "Metal artwork fabrication", "Structural steel modification", "Equipment welding", "Emergency welding repairs", "Installation services"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Construction", "Property Management"], "materials": ["Steel", "Aluminum", "Wrought Iron", "Iron"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Take time to understand customer needs", "Stay on schedule and communicate clearly", "Deliver work meeting highest standards every time", "Fourth-generation family craftsmanship", "On-site and mobile welding services"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1985 -> /about", "Fourth-generation family business -> /about", "Location Collingswood, NJ -> /", "Services: custom metal fabrication, welding, railings, fences, gates, safety, custom designs, mobile welding -> /services", "Materials: steel, aluminum, wrought iron -> /services", "Industries served: homeowners, contractors, business owners, property managers -> /", "Notable projects: Scottish Rite Auditorium, Battleship New Jersey, Jeremiah Trotter gate -> /about", "Differentiators: understand needs, stay on schedule, communicate clearly, highest standard -> /", "Company type: manufacturer of metal fabrications -> /"], "company_type": "Manufac