UPDATE companies SET description='Surf-Tech Manufacturing Corporation was founded in 1989 in Ronkonkoma, New York, in the technology and industry-rich heart of Suffolk County on Long Island. The company began as a contract manufacturer serving a broad range of industries and has remained at the same location, which offers quick access to component suppliers and transportation infrastructure, including proximity to Long Island MacArthur Airport.

The company provides full-service electronic manufacturing and assembly, specializing in surface mount technology (SMT), through-hole (TH) assembly, electro-mechanical box-build, and BGA assembly, rework, and replacement. It operates state-of-the-art automated placement equipment and supports both turnkey and consigned orders, with supply-chain connections that have enabled customers to shift to full turnkey arrangements. Services extend from prototype design to end-customer webstore fulfillment.

Surf-Tech serves customers across diverse industries, though the company does not publicly list specific sectors. Its client base includes organizations that require ITAR-registered manufacturing and IPC-certified workmanship, and the firm has maintained long-term relationships with many customers since its inception.

The company emphasizes quality and lean manufacturing, holding ISO 9001:2015 certification continuously since 2012 with zero third-party audit nonconformances. All inspectors maintain IPC-A-610 certification, and the facility uses a Cyberoptics 3D SQL automated inspection system for solder joint review and a VJ Electronicx X-ray machine for BGA and QFN inspection. Returns are reported at less than 0.01% annually, and functional testing is performed to customer-supplied fixtures and procedures.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ITAR registered','IPC-A-610','J-STD-001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Surface Mount (SMT) Assembly", "Through-Hole (TH) Assembly", "Electro-Mechanical (Box-Build) Assembly", "BGA Assembly, Rework & Replacement", "Turnkey Capability", "Consigned Order Support", "Prototype Design", "Webstore Fulfillment", "Automated Optical Inspection (Cyberoptics 3D SQL)", "X-Ray Inspection (VJ Electronicx)", "Functional Testing", "IPC-A-610 Inspection", "J-STD-001 Soldering"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Cyberoptics 3D SQL automated inspection system", "VJ Electronicx X-Ray machine"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9001:2015 certified since 2012 with zero third-party nonconformances", "ITAR registered", "Automated 3D solder joint inspection (Cyberoptics 3D SQL)", "X-ray inspection for BGA/QFN (VJ Electronicx)", "Turnkey and consigned order support with supply-chain cost savings", "Returns less than 0.01% annually"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1989 -> /about", "Headquarters in Ronkonkoma, New York -> /about", "Provides contract manufacturing services -> /about", "Specializes in SMT, TH, box-build, BGA assembly -> /about, /services, db", "Turnkey and consigned order support -> /about", "Supply-chain connections enabling turnkey conversion -> /about", "ISO 9001:2015 certified since 2012 with zero nonconformances -> /quality", "ITAR registered -> /about", "Personnel certified to IPC-A-610 and